---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="About | Abhishek Guha" description="About Abhishek Guha — a backend engineer interested in distributed systems, physics, and endurance.">
  <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A little context</p><h1>An engineer.<br /><em>A curious mind.</em></h1><p class="lead">I’m Abhishek Guha. I build backend systems and spend a lot of time wondering how things work.</p></header>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <aside><span class="meta-label">The short version</span><dl><div><dt>Work</dt><dd>Backend engineering</dd></div><div><dt>Focus</dt><dd>Distributed systems &amp; reliability</dd></div><div><dt>Exploring</dt><dd>AI engineering &amp; RAG</dd></div><div><dt>Outside work</dt><dd>Physics &amp; long-distance running</dd></div></dl></aside>
    <div class="prose"><h2>How I think about things.</h2><p>I am a software engineer focused on distributed systems, scalability, and reliability.</p><p>Beyond engineering, I am interested in physics, endurance sports, learning, and the study of complex systems.</p><p>Whether it's a backend service handling millions of requests, a marathon training cycle, or a physical process governed by simple laws, I am drawn to understanding how systems evolve, respond to stress, and improve over time.</p><p>This site is where I share what I am building, learning, and occasionally getting wrong before learning something better.</p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Step into the notebook <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="about-signoff"><span aria-hidden="true">↳</span><p>Build thoughtfully.<br /><em>Stay curious.</em></p></div>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
  h1 em { color: var(--accent); }
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 280px minmax(0, 650px); justify-content: space-between; gap: 65px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 40px; }
  aside .meta-label { color: var(--accent); }
  dl { margin-top: 25px; }
  dl div { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 15px; }
  dt { font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--muted); font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  dd { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; }
  .prose h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  .about-signoff { padding: 40px; background: var(--surface); margin-top: 50px; display: flex; gap: 25px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .about-signoff > span { color: var(--rust); font-size: 36px; }
  .about-signoff p { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin: 0; }
  .about-signoff em { color: var(--accent); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 25px; } dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0 20px; } .about-signoff { padding: 25px; } }
